    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b8b49579a28ae0cd42be986b",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "“青叶赏”是与“日本德比”相同，\n在东京赛场开办的GⅡ竞赛。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ee527bb0c7d96dd99dca9cdd5b6123e746aa1e35167425bf855de93cded10c8c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1083/storytimeline_501083304.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        17,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/17/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:349a7fd7afbb8c6987c69297",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "距离也与“日本德比”同样是2400米，\n的确够当成测试资质的前哨战。\n但是──",
      "source_fingerprint": "a45ed3e4b05fcf6b0b3c1ce31467264b05346c575a544e722cc0f4ebec87b58e",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
