    {
      "uid": "zhcn:663bb720b77ec9b64ee4062a",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "在“青叶赏”……获胜的赛马娘──\n无一……在德比夺冠。",
      "source_fingerprint": "20fd7d81b680a2aeea47cfe3844b1c4d5d1446eb64c76c5c90e546e3264b5793",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1083/storytimeline_501083304.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        20,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/20/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d8049491d06ffb34b1d6e023",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "正如吉兆所言，\n历史上在“青叶赏”获胜的赛马娘，\n不曾在“日本德比”中夺下胜利。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d6ae416ebab72002955d3c49ea0c95431e3074aa5418172d2daac0b233ec0f32",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1083/storytimeline_501083304.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        21,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/21/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c041ce1ffb1b474357f5d930",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "也有其他说法表示，是因为在2400米的竞赛后，\n紧接着又再出赛2400米的项目，\n这对经典级赛马娘而言，负担过于庞大──",
      "source_fingerprint": "4f2ddbe0ae66044295cde7cb464bd05548f300cf56b672e14c93cc12068e4e1d",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1083/storytimeline_501083304.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        22,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/22/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:460565e84a96d2246eb4e0b2",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "但没有人能确定其原因。\n因此到现在都一直被称为“‘青叶赏’的魔咒”。",
      "source_fingerprint": "595dabbf7ecd9409680e7ffd537ece080464861e97bdad95a5613ef5fd4a25ae",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
